WEBVTT

00:00:01.330 --> 00:00:05.806
SAM 3 labels for a Gaussian-splat scene, without the multiplex.

00:00:05.806 --> 00:00:08.043
Detection skips the multiplex, correctly.

00:00:08.043 --> 00:00:10.281
The exemplar pass under-uses it.

00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:12.038
The pipeline.

00:00:12.038 --> 00:00:14.252
Render views of the trained splat.

00:00:14.252 --> 00:00:16.097
Segment them with SAM 3.

00:00:16.097 --> 00:00:17.942
Lift the masks onto Gaussians.

00:00:19.050 --> 00:00:23.080
Exemplar pass, eight crops, 24 frames: frame passes.

00:00:23.080 --> 00:00:27.109
Reset between crops, 192; one sixteen-slot bucket, 24.

00:00:27.109 --> 00:00:28.620
That is 8×.

00:00:28.620 --> 00:00:32.146
Arithmetic over the loop, not a run.

00:00:33.050 --> 00:00:37.071
6 scenes in the internal calibration bank; no public benchmark.

00:00:38.050 --> 00:00:40.522
The thing works, and tells you where it might be wrong.

00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:48.358
Every number here is from the full article, with its sources, at ai.thesatyajit.com.
